  "goodToKnow": "Die Zeitgeschichte is contemporary history, the recent past still within living memory, in Germany often from 1917/18 or 1945 onwards. The Institut für Zeitgeschichte in Munich, founded in 1949, researches Nazism and post-war history. Zeitzeugen (contemporary witnesses), such as Holocaust survivors, often speak in schools. Zeitgeschichtlich means relating to contemporary history. It has no plural."
